  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The battle butler is proficient with all simple and martial weapons, light armor, but not with medium or heavy armor or with any shields. In addition, he is proficient in any weapon in the butler weapon group (see gentlemanly combat) and all firearms.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
